1
00:00:00,596 --> 00:00:04,306
(Sheldon:)You continue to underestimate
my capabilities, madam.

2
00:00:05,309 --> 00:00:08,019
(Penny:)Okay, let me put it this way.
If you're Leonard's friend...

3
00:00:08,187 --> 00:00:11,277
(Penny:)...you will support him
no matter who he wants to be with.

4
00:00:11,441 --> 00:00:14,781
(Sheldon:)Wait a minute.
Why am I doing all the giving here?

5
00:00:15,445 --> 00:00:16,945
(Sheldon:)If Leonard's really my friend...

6
00:00:17,113 --> 00:00:20,613
(Sheldon:)...why doesn't he have to support me
in my hatred of Leslie Winkle?

7
00:00:22,243 --> 00:00:24,953
(Penny:)Because love trumps hate.

8
00:00:25,788 --> 00:00:28,038
(Sheldon:)Oh, now you're just making stuff up.

9
00:00:28,791 --> 00:00:31,001
Okay. Good night, Sheldon.

10
00:00:32,712 --> 00:00:34,462
(Sheldon:)Oh, Mario.

11
00:00:34,630 --> 00:00:38,470
(Sheldon:)If only I could control everyone
the way I control you.

12
00:00:40,261 --> 00:00:43,471
(Sheldon:)Hop, you little plumber, hop, hop, hop.

13
00:00:47,769 --> 00:00:52,149
(Sheldon(entering):)When the two of you reach a natural
stopping point, I'd like to have a word.

14
00:00:52,315 --> 00:01:00,025
If the word is "pee-pee," just do it.

